<section class="section">
  <div class="container article-body" style="max-width:920px;">
    <h2>The Reese's Peanut Butter Cup Blizzard: The Standard for Salty-Sweet Decadence</h2>
    <p>Consistently ranking among Dairy Queen's top three most popular year-round orders alongside the <a href="/items/oreo-blizzard">Oreo Blizzard</a> and <a href="/items/cookie-dough-blizzard">Cookie Dough Blizzard</a>, the <strong>Reese's® Peanut Butter Cup Blizzard®</strong> represents the pinnacle of rich dairy satisfaction. Rather than artificial flavoring powders, the crew chops genuine Hershey's Reese's peanut butter cups directly into cold soft serve. As the high-speed spindle mixer pulverizes the candy, bits of milk chocolate shell fracture into crisp flakes, while the signature grainy, salted peanut butter core dissolves slightly into the cream, infusing the entire cup with roasted nutty richness. Review all options on <a href="/categories/blizzard-treats">Blizzard Treats</a> or browse <a href="/">The Queen Dairy Menu</a>.</p>

    <h2>Reese's Blizzard vs. Royal Reese's® Blizzard</h2>
    <p>Choosing between the classic cup and its Royal sibling comes down to how much liquid peanut butter you crave:</p>
    <div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table">
      <thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Standard Reese's® Blizzard</th><th>Royal Reese's® Blizzard</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><strong>Price Baseline</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$3.49 (Mini) / $4.49 (Small)</td><td class="price-cell">$3.99 (Mini) / $4.99 (Small)</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Center Core</strong></td><td>Uniformly blended candy pieces and soft serve</td><td>Liquid warm peanut butter sauce center cavity</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Calorie Profile (Small)</strong></td><td>600 cal</td><td>620 cal</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Texture</strong></td><td>Crisp chocolate edges with crumbly PB chunks</td><td>Molten warm peanut butter flowing into cold dairy</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table></div>

    <h2>Dietary and Caloric Advisory: Portions Matter</h2>
    <p>Due to the density of cocoa butter and roasted peanuts, the Reese's Blizzard is among the most energy-dense desserts in quick-service dining:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>The Mini ($3.49, ~360 cal):</strong> The perfect portion for satisfying an intense peanut butter craving without sluggishness after a meal.</li>
      <li><strong>The Small ($4.49, 600 cal):</strong> The single-serving sweet spot providing 12 grams of protein from dairy and real peanuts.</li>
      <li><strong>The Large ($6.49, ~1,210 cal):</strong> Packing more calories than a double burger and large fries combined, this size is strongly recommended for sharing between two or more dessert fans.</li>
    </ul>

